<title>USA: Identix secures contract.</title>
<headline>Identix secures contract.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Identix Inc said on Thursday its Innovative Archival Solutions unit has signed a three-year agreement with the Illinois State Police to supply contract live-scan fingerprint verification services.</p>
<p>The company said that more than 100,000 individuals could be fingerprinted in a given year.</p>
<p>Identix Chairman Randall Fowler said the contract is the only one of its kind in the nation to provide a statewide electronic fingerprinting service network.</p>
<p>Shares of Identix closed 1/16 lower at 9-1/4 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
